  "answer_text": "The website **www.profedcreditunion.com** (which redirects to [profedcu.org](https://www.profedcu.org)) is the official online portal for **ProFed Federal Credit Union**. \n\nProFed is a community-chartered federal credit union headquartered in **Fort Wayne, Indiana**, serving member-owners across northeast Indiana.\n\nKey details and resources about ProFed Credit Union include:\n\n### \ud83c\udfe6 General Information & Routing Number\n* **Routing Number (ABA):** `274973183` (Used for direct deposits, ACH transfers, and automatic payments).\n* **Headquarters Address:** 1710 St. Joe River Dr., Fort Wayne, IN 46805.\n* **Main Phone Number:** 260-483-0514.\n* **Federal Insurance:** Federally insured by the **NCUA** (National Credit Union Administration).\n\n### \ud83d\udccd Main Branch Locations (Northeast Indiana)\nProFed has branches located throughout several communities in Indiana, including:\n* **Fort Wayne** (Multiple locations: Corporate/Main, Dupont, Stellhorn, Hanna, Constitution, and Tonkel)\n* **Angola**\n* **Auburn**\n* **Bluffton**\n* **Columbia City**\n* **Decatur**\n* **Kendallville**\n* **New Haven**\n\n### \ud83d\udcbc Services Offered\nThrough their website, ProFed offers a full range of personal and business banking services, including:\n* **Personal Banking:** Savings accounts, checking accounts, certificates, and IRAs.\n* **Loans:** Auto loans, mortgages, home equity lines of credit (HELOCs), and personal loans.\n* **Credit Cards:** Visa\u00ae credit cards.\n* **Business Services:** Business checking, savings, commercial loans, and merchant services.\n* **Digital Banking:** Online and mobile banking, mobile check deposits, and card management apps (such as the *ProFed Digital Banking* and *ProFedCards* apps).\n\nIf you are looking for specific information such as current mortgage rates, branch hours, or how to open an account, you can access those services directly on their website.",
